   "body": "### Env token mixed with explicit keys\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`aws_session_token` falls back to `AWS_SESSION_TOKEN` on its own, then is attached whenever static keys are present. Keys from `api_config` therefore inherit a leftover environment token, which boto3 would not mix in, so previously valid long-lived keys are sent as mismatched temporary credentials and Bedrock rejects them.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: b45e39f0-fbef-4817-bab7-ebee50f47c25 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nredisvl/utils/vectorize/bedrock.py#L166-L187\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a></div>\n\n\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 8317e628a83e0f55d9ff12c8b44704e146d96352. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n"
